  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crisis affected and at-risk populations are rapidly protected and assisted, mitigating harm and enabling early recovery. As a result, lives are saved, dignity is maintained, and resilience is built.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian action is timely, data-driven, informed by affected populations, and reaching people in greatest need. When possible, populations are protected and assisted ahead of crisis onset.</narrative>
  </description>
